# Worker fragments are scratch. A worker writes one, the integrator splices it into
# app/shoot-for-the-moon.html and deletes it — the app file is the only copy that ships,
# and a stray fragment left lying around is exactly how T56 happened (two definitions of
# the rocket block, the later one silently winning for weeks). The reports beside them,
# workers/*.md, ARE tracked: they are the record of what each worker built and measured.
workers/*.js
